WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
And Ohio Zoo is asking the public

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.360
to name its newborn baby Rhino.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:05.680
You know, ABC did the same thing

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.240
after they adopted five new dairy cows.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.240
No, never failed.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.320
Why stop?

00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:19.440
J.B. Pritzker says President Trump deploying troops

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:24.000
to Chicago is due to his obsessive fixations.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.280
Yeah, this from the guy who every time he steps on a crack,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.400
he has to eat a pizza.

